 <section id="start"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">01 · Keep a second brain. Make a first prototype.</p><h2>Building VR real estate<br>experiences with free tools</h2><p class="lede">A downloadable starter kit you can edit and keep: a tool map, capture checklist, property brief, WebXR and Unreal learning paths, service-scope worksheet and experiment log.</p><div class="grid"><article class="card"><span class="step">CAPTURE</span><h3>Start with one room.</h3><p>Try <a href="https://scaniverse.nianticspatial.com/">Scaniverse</a> and its free on-device route. Compare <a href="https://learn.poly.cam/hc/en-us/articles/27425185907348-How-to-Use-Object-Mode">Polycam</a>, whose splat creation requires a paid plan. Plan overlapping coverage and check current export limits.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="step">CLEAN + VIEW</span><h3>Make it worth visiting.</h3><p>Use the free, open-source <a href="https://superspl.at/editor/">SuperSplat editor</a> and <a href="https://developer.playcanvas.com/user-manual/supersplat/viewer/">viewer</a>. Inspect glass, missing surfaces, scale and the route. A splat is a captured appearance, not a measured survey.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="step">BUILD + TEST</span><h3>Give someone a way in.</h3><p>Learn <a href="https://aframe.io/docs/1.7.0/introduction/">A-Frame / WebXR</a> or <a href="https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/unreal-engine/first-hour-in-unreal-engine">Unreal basics</a>. Start small, test the actual device and supply a desktop fallback. Headsets and commercial delivery may cost money.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="pmre2026-vr-real-estate-starter-kit-2026-11-18.zip" download>Download the complete kit (.zip)</a><a class="button secondary" href="pmre2026-second-brain-starter-kit.md" download>Download as one Markdown file</a><a class="button secondary" href="second-brain/00-start-here.md">Browse the editable notes</a></div><p class="small">No signup required. Verified official links, checked November 18, 2026. Free tiers have limits; <a href="https://www.nianticspatial.com/en/pricing">check capture plans</a> and <a href="https://www.unrealengine.com/license">Unreal licensing</a>. Immersive WebXR normally needs HTTPS and a compatible headset/browser.</p></div></section>
